OL,3,GNEWSAPool pollution believed to be from
OL,4,Acesspit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ladies' Pool at La Vallette in
OL,7,FGuernsey could reopen next week as
OL,8,Fauthorities believe they have dealt
OL,9,Fwith the cause of the pollution that
OL,10,Fled to its closure.
OL,12,FEnvironmental Health closed the pool on
OL,13,FWednesday after sewage was found in
OL,14,Froutine testing, which was started
OL,15,Fafter BBC footage identified a fault
OL,16,Fwith the sewage outfall at Soldier's
OL,17,FBay that has yet to be fixed.
OL,19,FDirector of Environmental Health Tobin
OL,20,FCook said there was no evidence linking
OL,21,Fthe faulty outfall and the issue at the
OL,22,Fpool.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
