OL,3,GNEWSAPool pollution believed to be from
OL,4,Acesspit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was waiting on a formal
OL,7,Freport into the cause before the pool
OL,8,Fcould reopen, although he was confident
OL,9,Fthe problem was with the site's cesspit
OL,10,Fand a temporary solution was already in
OL,11,Fplace.
